		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6ec3785 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="6ec3785" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-65ef77b8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="65ef77b8" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2250a7c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2250a7c5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Mentorship Is Affordable</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7ea3a07f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7ea3a07f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span>You want to launch a successful career in the film industry but you don’t want to compromise your financial future in the process. <br />Film Connection provides unique, mentor-based programs that are affordable, so you can stay in control of your finances. <br />Find out how Film Connection keeps costs affordable across all of our offered audio programs and how we help you stay in control of your finances.<br /><br />Don’t let the burden of student debt prevent your from pursuing a career in the film industry. Film Connection is here to help make your passion for a music a professional future.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-13329e33 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="13329e33" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-51cf712f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="51cf712f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="843" src="https://filmconnection.com/wp-content/uploads/affordable-tuition.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-27664" alt="" srcset="https://filmconnection.com/wp-content/uploads/affordable-tuition.webp 839w, https://filmconnection.com/wp-content/uploads/affordable-tuition-600x632.webp 600w, https://filmconnection.com/wp-content/uploads/affordable-tuition-285x300.webp 285w, https://filmconnection.com/wp-content/uploads/affordable-tuition-768x809.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2e77bdf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2e77bdf" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
