		<style id="loop-dynamic-26074">.e-loop-item-38840 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b83de23:not(.elementor-motion-effects-element-type-background), .e-loop-item-38840 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b83de23 > .elementor-motion-effects-container > .elementor-motion-effects-layer{background-image:url("https://filmconnection.com/wp-content/uploads/korey-hehn_hdr.webp");}</style>		<div data-elementor-type="loop-item" data-elementor-id="26074" class="elementor elementor-26074 swiper-slide e-loop-item e-loop-item-38840 post-38840 success-stories type-success-stories status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry" data-elementor-post-type="elementor_library" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" data-custom-edit-handle="1">
			<a class="elementor-element elementor-element-91f4703 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="91f4703" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" href="https://filmconnection.com/success-stories/korey-hehn/">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b83de23 e-con-full ss-box e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b83de23" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4350019 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4350019" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									&#8220;Korey Hehn gained valuable hands-on experience through Film Connection, working on commercials, film videos, and various editing tasks, which helped build her confidence in different aspects of production. After graduating, she worked as a script supervisor and hair/makeup assistant on a web series in Colorado, further solidifying her passion for the industry.								</div>
